            0.111,
            0.802,
            0.848,
            0.842
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What if a person ate 3 varieties of rice every day? Will they be able to taste all the lakh varieties in a 100 year lifetime? Find out."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.851,
            0.849,
            0.908
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Estu said, “We know how many days there are in a year — 365, if we ignore leap years. If we live for y years, the number of days in our lifetime will be 365 × y.”"
            }
          ]
        },
